        "filing_date": "2025-08-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In the early 2000s, by recycling our own production waste into useful polyester fibers, we took the first steps toward building an important supply chain with a focus on sustainability and environmental responsibility.",
